deterministic typesetting engine. It is exactly that. And to leave you with a final conceptual shift to mull over,

59:52.640 --> 59:58.400
if you follow the logic of everything we have discussed, you must conclude that the PDF you read is merely an illusion.

59:58.400 --> 01:00:03.760
An illusion. The true artifact, the actual substance of your work is the source tree,

01:00:03.760 --> 01:00:10.560
the repository. The PDF is nothing more than a temporary flattened visual projection of your data,

01:00:10.560 --> 01:00:17.200
your logic, and your prose captured at one specific moment in time. If you master the architecture of the

01:00:17.200 --> 01:00:22.880
source tree, you are no longer bound to a single medium. You can alter the final output target and

01:00:22.880 --> 01:00:28.480
project that identical source tree into a book, an interactive website, or a responsive APUB seamlessly.

01:00:29.120 --> 01:00:33.840
The power you are seeking is not located on the printed page. The power is entirely in the pipeline.

01:00:33.840 --> 01:00:39.440
The power is in the pipeline. That is an incredible place to conclude. Thank you so much for joining us

01:00:39.440 --> 01:00:44.320
on this Custom Deep Dive. The next time you sit down to initiate a complex writing project,

01:00:44.320 --> 01:00:48.480
I hope you look at a blank screen not as a piece of digital paper waiting for ink,

01:00:48.480 --> 01:01:01.440
but as a robust, programmable system waiting to be beautifully designed. Until next time.

